<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ToolMem</span>: Enhancing Multimodal Agents with 
<br class="ltx_break">Learnable Tool Capability Memory</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
