<span id="A2.SS1.p5.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p5.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Describe the expected image in no more than 50 English words. Be concise and specific. 
