<br class="ltx_break">Based on your memory of model <span id="A2.SS1.p6.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{model_name}</span>, predict the score for the following prompt: “<span id="A2.SS1.p6.pic1.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{prompt}</span>”. 
